WEBVTT

01:44.020 --> 01:45.897
Look at this, gentlemen.

01:45.980 --> 01:47.649
This is an illustrated story.

01:48.274 --> 01:51.402
It is a spectacular picture scroll
of great magnitude.

01:51.486 --> 01:54.697
Professor, could this profile be of...

01:54.781 --> 01:59.035
Yes. I am quite certain
it is that devil we saw earlier.

01:59.119 --> 02:02.997
Then, Professor, what is
this little devil that's facing it?

02:03.498 --> 02:08.253
Most likely, they are parent and child,
father and son.

02:09.254 --> 02:14.050
And then, what is this enormous crowd
of people behind the father?

02:14.551 --> 02:17.345
I was just considering that.

02:17.428 --> 02:20.306
Upon close inspection,
there is an abundance of variation.

02:20.890 --> 02:23.059
In race, gender, and age.

02:23.643 --> 02:26.688
Ostensibly, this crowd appears
to be his followers.

02:26.771 --> 02:32.026
Perhaps, these beings
are glorifying him, the father devil.

02:32.527 --> 02:34.362
Is he some kind of icon?

02:34.445 --> 02:35.280
Yes.

02:37.949 --> 02:39.826
Boss, sorry 'bout this.

02:40.410 --> 02:43.580
We can't get any farther than this.
Want me to scare them off?

02:44.414 --> 02:46.583
No. Here is fine.

02:47.417 --> 02:51.588
Even though you've lost your hearing,
and you cannot hear, listen.

02:52.797 --> 02:54.507
What we, Yujiro and Baki,

02:54.591 --> 02:58.261
are about to do is not a continuation
of what has come before.

02:58.344 --> 03:00.722
But it isn't the beginning either.

03:04.475 --> 03:06.728
With this, we conclude.

03:08.146 --> 03:10.064
<i>With this, it ends.</i>

03:14.694 --> 03:16.487
From your pinky, go like this.

03:17.071 --> 03:19.324
One by one. Right.

03:20.867 --> 03:23.620
This is the greatest tool in the world.

03:24.287 --> 03:25.246
Tool...

03:25.955 --> 03:29.876
It can function as various everyday tools.

03:30.460 --> 03:32.295
And obviously...

03:32.378 --> 03:33.504
Obviously?

03:34.088 --> 03:35.256
It can be a weapon.

03:35.840 --> 03:39.385
It can be a hammer, a blade,
or even a spear.

03:41.471 --> 03:43.765
First, this is how
to make it into a hammer.

03:45.600 --> 03:47.268
From the pinky, go like this.

03:48.019 --> 03:49.562
Fold each finger to its base.

03:49.646 --> 03:52.607
One by one, from the ring finger
to the middle finger.

03:52.690 --> 03:53.524
Good.

03:54.192 --> 03:56.277
This one is the opposite of before.

03:56.861 --> 03:59.197
From the index finger,
fold them one by one.

03:59.280 --> 04:01.282
To complete it, fold the thumb over them.

04:02.075 --> 04:03.534
What have you grasped?

04:06.371 --> 04:09.666
Strength. You've grasped strength.

04:11.084 --> 04:13.378
You punch with the strength
you've grasped.

04:13.878 --> 04:16.798
You pierce with the strength
you've grasped.

04:16.881 --> 04:19.467
It is humanity's oldest and finest weapon.

04:21.594 --> 04:23.304
That is the fist.

04:24.347 --> 04:26.849
<i>Release the tension
from the fingers that are folded,</i>

04:26.933 --> 04:28.977
<i>and gently hold them
in place with the thumb.</i>

04:29.769 --> 04:31.479
<i>Don't be concerned about your stance.</i>

04:32.272 --> 04:34.691
<i>Leave the placement of your fist
up to your body.</i>

04:36.442 --> 04:37.986
You never forget these things.

04:38.569 --> 04:42.991
<i>The beginning of the beginning.
The first knowledge Dad gave me.</i>

04:43.074 --> 04:46.911
Boss, I think there are only ten rows
of people in front of us.

04:46.995 --> 04:49.747
What do you wanna do?
Want me to scare 'em off?

04:52.083 --> 04:54.252
No. Here is fine.

04:54.836 --> 04:56.838
<i>Completely forget about defending.</i>

04:57.338 --> 05:00.133
<i>Concentrate your weight
on the ball of your forward foot.</i>

05:00.216 --> 05:02.885
<i>Focus only on throwing the punch.</i>

05:02.969 --> 05:05.555
<i>Consider all else to be impurities.</i>

05:06.306 --> 05:09.684
<i>The fist that you've placed your
entire self into will surpass everything.</i>

05:10.685 --> 05:14.314
<i>There is no "will it work or not work."
There's no need to even think that!</i>

05:15.023 --> 05:18.067
<i>That's what a comparison
of strength is like!</i>

05:19.319 --> 05:21.571
<i>The sound of their knuckles
hitting their faces</i>

05:22.238 --> 05:26.075
<i>must have been the loudest sound
the two of them had made that evening.</i>

05:43.718 --> 05:47.096
<i>Removing oneself from danger
and defeating your enemy.</i>

05:48.222 --> 05:49.724
<i>That is the art of fighting.</i>

05:50.391 --> 05:51.726
<i>That is technique.</i>

05:52.352 --> 05:55.355
<i>Casting off all defense
and exposing the front of his body</i>,

05:56.105 --> 05:57.857
<i>where vital spots are concentrated,</i>

05:57.940 --> 05:59.442
<i>to the blade.</i>

05:59.942 --> 06:04.864
<i>That is no longer a martial art,
nor even a combat sport,</i>

06:06.157 --> 06:09.243
<i>but a comparison of strength,
a comparison of manhood.</i>

06:11.746 --> 06:13.039
Excuse me.

06:13.581 --> 06:15.249
- What?
<i>-</i> Huh?

06:19.337 --> 06:20.505
What?

06:20.588 --> 06:21.798
I can't see.

06:21.881 --> 06:22.757
Who's that?

06:22.840 --> 06:26.803
That... that is Ogre.

06:31.849 --> 06:33.059
What's he doing?

06:33.142 --> 06:34.268
Praying?

06:34.352 --> 06:36.020
You know, it seems like...

06:36.104 --> 06:40.024
There sure seems to be
a lot more foreigners here now. Right?

06:44.028 --> 06:45.279
Ogre...

06:51.869 --> 06:53.913
Whoa! Awesome!

06:53.996 --> 06:55.832
Neither of them are giving an inch!

06:55.915 --> 06:58.543
It's a slugfest
between the world's strongest!

06:58.626 --> 07:00.420
There's actually someone who...

07:00.503 --> 07:03.423
Going fisticuffs face-to-face with Ogre...

07:03.506 --> 07:06.426
Who knew there was
anyone in the world who'd do that?

07:06.509 --> 07:09.804
Boss, I can't believe this.

07:09.887 --> 07:13.182
He's in a slugfest with that Yujiro Hanma.

07:14.434 --> 07:15.476
I'm jealous.

07:16.644 --> 07:19.689
Then, why don't we move a little closer?

07:19.772 --> 07:22.275
No, here is fine.

07:22.775 --> 07:23.693
Yessir.

07:23.776 --> 07:25.319
You're at the front already.

07:26.070 --> 07:27.280
<i>It's certain now...</i>

07:27.363 --> 07:29.824
<i>When this breathless flurry
of punches ends,</i>

07:30.616 --> 07:35.121
<i>that is when this fight will be settled.</i>

07:40.293 --> 07:41.711
<i>The weak masses...</i>

07:42.753 --> 07:44.213
<i>The weak masses...</i>

07:44.922 --> 07:46.966
<i>Standing before the weak masses</i>

07:47.842 --> 07:48.968
<i>was an</i> oni.

07:50.136 --> 07:52.430
<i>Behind him were the weak masses.</i>

07:53.139 --> 07:55.808
<i>There was always a crowd of the weak.</i>

07:56.309 --> 07:59.228
<i>In front of the weak there were always</i>

07:59.812 --> 08:02.648
<i>yes, strong soldiers.</i>

08:04.150 --> 08:05.735
<i>The man had made up his mind.</i>

08:06.486 --> 08:09.739
<i>My place is always in front of the strong.</i>

08:12.742 --> 08:15.495
<i>There is no justice. There is no evil.</i>

08:16.245 --> 08:18.456
<i>There is only strength.</i>

08:20.082 --> 08:23.377
<i>Eventually, the name "Ogre"
was given by one major nation</i>

08:23.461 --> 08:28.257
<i>to this man, who had found his way
to the country's leader so easily.</i>

08:28.758 --> 08:32.762
<i>Truly quivering with fear,
they hid in the shadows of “God,</i>”

08:33.387 --> 08:35.640
<i>and bought his favor
for vast sums of dollars.</i>

08:36.599 --> 08:39.018
<i>The weak masses,
who had been driven to despair,</i>

08:39.644 --> 08:44.273
<i>deified this utmost threat
to powerful nations</i>

08:44.857 --> 08:46.651
<i>and loved him as an angel.</i>

08:48.236 --> 08:52.365
<i>The ring that encircled the father
and son gradually shrank in size.</i>

08:53.449 --> 08:57.036
<i>The field of energy from this father
and son that was about at its end,</i>

08:57.119 --> 09:00.081
<i>they wanted to be near it,
and feel it up close.</i>

09:00.623 --> 09:02.583
<i>They wanted it engraved in their minds!</i>

09:03.918 --> 09:06.546
<i>The son's fists felt his father.</i>

09:07.421 --> 09:09.549
<i>What did the father's fists feel?</i>

09:10.341 --> 09:14.804
<i>Both men's fists sought
for the most effective angle possible.</i>

09:15.471 --> 09:17.306
<i>Both men's feet sought</i>

09:17.390 --> 09:20.434
<i>for the most effective
landing point possible.</i>

09:21.644 --> 09:27.483
<i>This domestic trouble was broadcast
via TV cameras and via cell phones,</i>

09:28.568 --> 09:32.989
<i>to living rooms
and computer screens nationwide.</i>

09:33.781 --> 09:34.782
SHINSHINKAI HEADQUARTERS

09:34.865 --> 09:37.535
<i>Are you watching, Dad?</i>

09:38.786 --> 09:41.706
<i>In this competition, I...</i>

09:42.748 --> 09:48.212
<i>Whose victory do I wish for in this match?</i>

09:50.923 --> 09:52.216
Father...

09:55.303 --> 09:57.972
I can do this too!

09:58.931 --> 10:01.017
<i>Was it to show pride in his toughness?</i>

10:02.268 --> 10:05.479
<i>Or to embrace his beloved son,
who was on a spurt?</i>

10:06.188 --> 10:10.276
<i>The father quietly held
his open palms wide apart.</i>

10:25.583 --> 10:27.251
<i>Am I able to see?</i>

10:28.127 --> 10:29.754
<i>Am I able to hear?</i>

10:32.798 --> 10:34.800
<i>My fists punching my father's body...</i>

10:35.343 --> 10:38.262
<i>I can definitely feel my fists
striking my father.</i>

10:39.805 --> 10:45.019
<i>My numbing fists are the only connection
between my father and me.</i>

10:46.520 --> 10:48.606
<i>Am I actually punching him?</i>

10:49.106 --> 10:52.735
<i>Am I being punched back?</i>

10:53.611 --> 10:56.280
<i>This is our chance
to make contact with each other.</i>

10:57.323 --> 10:59.992
<i>What a waste it would be
to throw regular punches.</i>

11:01.702 --> 11:05.790
<i>That's right. I'll punch him
as if I'm hugging him.</i>

11:19.887 --> 11:22.515
<i>There go my ribs.</i>

11:23.391 --> 11:26.310
<i>Two, three, maybe more.</i>

11:27.228 --> 11:30.564
<i>He's amazing. My dad is really amazing.</i>

11:34.652 --> 11:35.820
<i>How many times?</i>

11:37.029 --> 11:41.409
<i>How many times tonight
have I said he's amazing?</i>

11:56.716 --> 11:57.675
<i>This is the same...</i>

12:00.803 --> 12:02.596
<i>as that time five years ago.</i>

12:17.278 --> 12:19.488
<i>Mandible fractured.</i>

12:20.114 --> 12:22.450
<i>Mental tubercle fractured.</i>

12:23.284 --> 12:25.286
<i>Mandibular ramus fractured.</i>

12:25.828 --> 12:27.872
<i>Numerous fissures as well.</i>

12:28.456 --> 12:30.958
<i>Left orbital floor fractured.</i>

12:32.084 --> 12:33.794
<i>Nasal bone collapsed.</i>

12:34.420 --> 12:36.297
<i>Maxillary fractured.</i>

12:37.047 --> 12:39.133
<i>Numerous fissures as well.</i>

12:39.842 --> 12:42.261
<i>Abrasion of front teeth and molars.</i>

12:42.762 --> 12:45.473
<i>Multiple missing and damaged.</i>

12:47.391 --> 12:50.644
<i>Both ear drums burst.</i>

12:51.270 --> 12:55.775
<i>Cervical vertebra sprained on both sides.
Over 30 degrees.</i>

12:56.734 --> 12:59.528
<i>Ribs. Six fractures.</i>

13:00.613 --> 13:05.409
<i>Bones and wrists in both hands.
Slight inflammation.</i>

13:06.869 --> 13:09.789
<i>Bones in both feet. Slight sprains.</i>

13:10.498 --> 13:12.333
<i>As well as slight inflammation.</i>

13:14.919 --> 13:17.838
<i>Subcutaneous bleeding all over the body.</i>

13:19.089 --> 13:23.010
<i>Brain and organs. Several sites of...</i>

13:28.682 --> 13:30.184
That's enough already.

13:34.647 --> 13:37.316
<i>That is enough. Any continuation,</i>

13:38.192 --> 13:42.571
<i>any more punches
and it wouldn't be a fight.</i>

13:43.531 --> 13:45.115
<i>It wouldn't be the Great Brute.</i>

13:54.792 --> 13:55.668
Thanks, man!

13:56.168 --> 13:57.837
Thank you!

13:58.420 --> 13:59.839
Thank you, sir.

13:59.922 --> 14:00.923
Thanks, man!

14:01.006 --> 14:01.924
Thank you!

14:02.007 --> 14:02.842
Thanks!

14:03.509 --> 14:05.469
<i>That was a time well spent.</i>

14:18.315 --> 14:19.859
You kicked me.

14:23.445 --> 14:27.616
<i>As I walked away, you sent me off
with a blow to the side of my face.</i>

14:45.050 --> 14:45.885
Yes...

14:50.890 --> 14:51.974
Yes...

14:54.101 --> 14:55.144
I see.

14:58.981 --> 15:01.150
Yes, nice.

15:01.233 --> 15:04.278
<i>His fighting spirit... still unbroken.</i>

15:04.361 --> 15:06.238
<i>I can't stand to watch.</i>

15:11.869 --> 15:15.539
Fine. Baki, that's enough.

15:28.802 --> 15:30.804
What? No way...

15:31.388 --> 15:32.806
<i>Is that...</i>

15:33.807 --> 15:36.894
<i>Tofu?</i>

15:38.646 --> 15:40.564
<i>The audience saw it clearly.</i>

15:42.066 --> 15:44.985
<i>The tofu in his palm as he sliced it.</i>

15:46.862 --> 15:49.573
<i>The leeks as he sliced them
on a cutting board.</i>

15:50.658 --> 15:54.328
<i>The cherished dish
of the Great Brute, Yujiro Hanma.</i>

15:55.496 --> 15:57.331
<i>Miso soup with tofu.</i>

15:58.040 --> 16:01.835
Hey. It's ready. Get up.

16:03.295 --> 16:06.340
<i>Oh... Is it that time?</i>

16:08.050 --> 16:09.343
<i>Unprecedented.</i>

16:11.178 --> 16:14.807
<i>The first and probably the last
nighttime "air-snack."</i>

16:21.105 --> 16:22.439
<i>This is all I've got.</i>

16:23.482 --> 16:26.610
<i>It's more than enough, Father.</i>

16:27.194 --> 16:30.364
<i>Cut that out, you. Call me "dad."</i>

16:30.447 --> 16:31.865
<i>They...</i>

16:31.949 --> 16:33.617
<i>They're...</i>

16:33.701 --> 16:35.703
They're sitting in harmony.

16:40.708 --> 16:42.751
<i>Are you okay with doing this here?</i>

16:43.460 --> 16:46.463
<i>Oh come on, it doesn't matter where.</i>

16:47.506 --> 16:49.383
<i>Relax and sit normally.</i>

16:52.636 --> 16:53.637
<i>It'll get cold.</i>

16:54.513 --> 16:55.472
<i>Thank you.</i>

17:00.269 --> 17:01.145
<i>That's wrong.</i>

17:03.731 --> 17:05.607
<i>I've noticed this before.</i>

17:05.691 --> 17:07.401
<i>You're not holding them properly.</i>

17:08.068 --> 17:10.154
<i>This ain't no fancy exclusive restaurant.</i>

17:17.286 --> 17:18.412
<i>That's good.</i>

17:19.830 --> 17:21.290
<i>But it's a little salty.</i>

17:25.794 --> 17:28.672
<i>You don't even know how
a proper miso soup is supposed to taste.</i>

17:31.383 --> 17:33.177
<i>Okay, why don't you try it yourself?</i>

17:35.763 --> 17:36.847
<i>Go ahead.</i>

17:37.431 --> 17:38.599
Don't be stupid.

17:39.183 --> 17:43.103
Make-believe is still just make-believe.
It doesn't even taste like water.

17:46.523 --> 17:47.357
<i>Is that so?</i>

17:50.694 --> 17:53.113
What?!

17:54.406 --> 17:56.116
The son turned the table!

17:56.200 --> 17:57.367
Why, you...

18:04.500 --> 18:05.417
They disappeared!

18:06.001 --> 18:07.086
The table...

18:07.169 --> 18:08.170
The bowl...

18:08.921 --> 18:09.755
Dad.

18:09.838 --> 18:10.672
Yeah?

18:14.718 --> 18:16.428
You were saved.

18:21.141 --> 18:24.436
Are you saying <i>you</i> saved me?!

18:28.565 --> 18:29.942
That's exactly right.

18:30.025 --> 18:35.030
I know what you're referring to.
That miso soup was a little salty.

18:35.531 --> 18:36.698
He acknowledged it!

18:36.782 --> 18:37.908
So, it <i>was</i> salty?

18:37.991 --> 18:38.951
Whoa...

18:40.661 --> 18:44.706
I didn't want to admit it,
so I tried to deceive you.

18:45.541 --> 18:47.167
I lied.

18:48.335 --> 18:49.962
<i>Ogre lied?</i>

18:53.632 --> 18:56.468
You noticed I was rattled,

18:56.552 --> 19:00.222
so you turned the table to save me.

19:05.185 --> 19:07.729
The basic measure of strength is...

19:10.566 --> 19:12.651
the strength to see your desires through.

19:13.193 --> 19:15.070
The strength to see your will through.

19:16.071 --> 19:20.576
You made me, the strongest man on Earth,
stand in the kitchen.

19:22.202 --> 19:24.663
There is no greater selfishness than this.

19:25.831 --> 19:29.459
Claim the title of strongest in the world,
right here!

19:35.716 --> 19:36.842
He acknowledged it!

19:36.925 --> 19:38.510
Ogre acknowledged it!

19:38.594 --> 19:41.013
He acknowledged
that Baki is the strongest!

19:41.096 --> 19:44.516
Baki Hanma is the strongest in the world!

19:47.227 --> 19:48.520
"In the end...

19:50.689 --> 19:52.774
whoever is standing at the highest point,

19:53.525 --> 19:56.862
with their head in a higher position,

19:57.571 --> 20:00.032
the one looking down on the other,
is the victor."

20:01.158 --> 20:02.534
Those are your words, Dad.

20:03.660 --> 20:06.622
You definitely looked down on me and left.

20:08.040 --> 20:10.125
At that time, I was already killed.

20:12.127 --> 20:13.545
That's an irrefutable fact.

20:14.922 --> 20:15.881
I lost.

20:16.965 --> 20:18.717
<i>He still could not hear,</i>

20:19.218 --> 20:21.803
<i>and did not know he was now
the strongest in the world.</i>

20:21.887 --> 20:23.138
He acknowledged it!

20:23.222 --> 20:25.807
The strongest in the world
declared his defeat!

20:25.891 --> 20:27.935
What an incredible finish!

20:29.186 --> 20:33.690
<i>The decisive words clearly spoken
by the son of the world's strongest.</i>

20:35.442 --> 20:37.194
<i>Whether it was a whim of the night,</i>

20:37.277 --> 20:40.155
<i>the father handed over
his title of world's strongest,</i>

20:40.239 --> 20:42.449
<i>and the son handed over the victory.</i>

20:43.033 --> 20:45.202
We have a winner!

20:46.662 --> 20:50.540
<i>Each of them both offered the other
the greatest they had to offer.</i>

20:54.211 --> 20:55.420
How happy-go-lucky.

20:57.506 --> 20:58.674
He's gotten better.

21:00.300 --> 21:03.845
<i>The world's strongest father-son fight</i>

21:05.138 --> 21:06.723
<i>ends here!</i>

21:09.810 --> 21:12.729
THE END

22:48.700 --> 22:51.328
It's reported that the match itself
was an exhibition.

22:51.912 --> 22:55.582
What are your thoughts on the fact
that it was not an official match?

22:56.541 --> 22:58.085
I did not use my feet.

22:58.960 --> 23:00.170
I did not use my knees.

23:01.421 --> 23:03.090
I did not use my elbows.

23:04.299 --> 23:05.675
I only used my two fists.

23:08.261 --> 23:12.349
<i>By only attacking Mr. Bolt's upper body
and only facing him head on,</i>

23:13.350 --> 23:14.935
<i>I won this fight.</i>

23:16.436 --> 23:17.854
I was the victor.

23:18.647 --> 23:20.690
It was nothing more or less than that.

23:21.691 --> 23:24.861
Whether it was official or unofficial.

23:26.279 --> 23:28.949
Also, whether the belt that Kaiser gave me

23:29.991 --> 23:32.202
was officially recognized or unrecognized...

23:32.953 --> 23:35.497
Those are things that I do not know,

23:35.580 --> 23:36.998
nor do they interest me.

23:37.582 --> 23:38.750
Oh...

23:39.376 --> 23:44.089
Using just a small portion
of my main skill, kung fu,

23:44.714 --> 23:46.633
I was victorious under boxing rules.

23:47.551 --> 23:48.635
That is all!
